ry strong hands\n\nReason:\nI have the absolute nuts (best possible straight). My opponent has called three streets of betting, indicating they have something worth defending. A medium-sized value bet of around 800-1000 chips maximizes my expected value - it's large enough to build a substantial pot but small enough that hands like two-pair, sets, or smaller straights might call. Checking would be too passive with such a strong hand, and going all-in would likely fold out everything I can get value from.\n\nAnswer: 800"}
